1, he had been touring with Frank Ocean the week before (~2023-05-22/28) and called it \"wild\"; the Tokyo show was \"unreal\" — the crowd was \"insane\" — and performing \"felt so alive\" he \"can't find the words to express it\"; the energy and love from the fans was \"crazy\" [S7T1][S7T3]. This was the Frank Ocean tour his planned Boston trip was to follow (see the Boston trip section below); as of 2023-05-31, Boston is a stop on this tour itself.\n- On 2023-08-14, updated Dave that the tour with the well-known artist (the Frank Ocean tour, see above) ended with a show in Japan — the Tokyo show was \"awesome\": everyone was \"so into it\" when he played one of his songs and sang along, which he called \"a magical moment\"; feeling of performing and connecting with the audience \"was unreal\"; after the tour he had the opportunity to explore his new place (the Japanese mansion, see ## New home (2023-03-23)) — \"it's like a dream come true!\" [S14T4][S14T6].","text_sha256":"671214eca3effc60f09cb88791f7bbdc5efe59b22ddd7b389b2c4489f10a85b5","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D24:9","D24:10","D24:11"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":61,"line_start":61,"source_locators":["[S24T9]","[S24T10]","[S24T11]"],"text_sha256":"8e7bdf92071b1e13552604f10b2a90728cc1dcab8fe69506f319455b267cc63e"}],"dia_ids":["D24:9","D24:10","D24:11"],"evidence_id":"ev-7d520df4e5bd639f5d86cc795c5c3a891cbcdbbb6f374c80305a5932167a33f5","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":61,"line_start":61,"observation_ids":["obs-0004"],"path":"/memories/calvin.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":4,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Calvin > ## Tokyo trip (2023-04-20)","selection_ordinal":2,"session_id":"session_24","source_kind":"curated","source_locators":["[S24T9]","[S24T10]","